{"d":"<p>Ja palodžu pasūtī&scaron;ana &scaron;ķiet sarežģīta, iesakām vēlamo izmēru sarakstu atsūtīt uz e-pastu <a href=\"mailto:birojs@buvvvide.lv?subject=KSP%20palod%C5%BEu%20pas%C5%ABt%C4%ABjums\">birojs@buvvvide.lv</a></p>\r\n<p>Palodzes iespējams saņemt mūsu birojā nākamajā līdz 3 darba dienu laikā pēc apmaksas veik&scaron;anas.</p><br><br>","t":{"KSP laminēts laminēta ar toni":"<p><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/lamineta-ksp.jpg\" width=\"350\" height=\"135\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>- Pamatmateriāls: kokskaidu plātne P2 saskaņā ar EN 312</p>\r\n<p>- Virsma: CPL lamināts 0,4mm saskaņā ar EN 438<br />\r\n- Palodzes apak&scaron;a un aizmugure: impregnēts papīrs<br />\r\n- Līme: D3 saskaņā ar EN 204<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); width: 581.031px; line-height: 20.48px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 14px;\">Kokskaidu palodžu izmēri:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); width: 581.031px; line-height: 20.48px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 14px;\">- Pamatnes biezums: 18 mm<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Palodzes deguna biezums / platums: 18 mm / 38 mm<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Maksimālais garums: 4100 mm</span></p>","KSP laminēta palodze balta":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/palodze/lam_baltamat.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"83\" width=\"111\" vspace=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/viskas/palodze/lam_baltamat.jpg\" alt=\"balta matēta\" /></a></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); width: 581.031px; line-height: 20.48px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 14px;\">- Pamatmateriāls: kokskaidu plātne P2 saskaņā ar EN 312<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Virsma: CPL lamināts 0,4mm saskaņā ar EN 438<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Palodzes apak&scaron;a un aizmugure: impregnēts papīrs<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Līme: D3 saskaņā ar EN 204</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); width: 581.031px; line-height: 20.48px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 14px;\">Kokskaidu palodžu izmēri:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); width: 581.031px; line-height: 20.48px; padding: 0px 0px 10px; font-family: &quot;Open Sans&quot;, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 14px;\">- Pamatnes biezums: 18 mm<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Palodzes deguna biezums / platums: 18 mm / 38 mm<br style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\" />\r\n- Maksimālais garums: 4100 mm</span></p>"}}